<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimates, to September 4 of total 1995/96 purchases by Argentine oilseed crushers and wheat millers in the indicated crop year (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Wheat    (Dec-Jan)    3,850</p>
<p> Soybeans (Apr-Mar)    6,763</p>
<p> Sunseeds (Jan-Dec)    3,623</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
